{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"I found a mushroom and ate it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:06:14.322000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740737466801192984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Their eyes widen. “Which area of the forest?”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:06:51.481000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740737622657335376","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"I don't know. Mushrooms everywhere. They called to me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:07:12.835000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740737712222634014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"“Did they glow?”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:07:48.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740737863443808368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Cato nods","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:08:15.895000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740737976715182111","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They nod slowly. “I know those. What did you see?”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:08:36.256000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740738062115536908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Elith.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:08:48.582000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740738113814396989","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"“Your friend?”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:08:58.702000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740738156260753439","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"He nods. \"I had forgotten so much. My heart pushed the memories far away. I forgot that we loved eachother. We kissed under the moon.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:09:46.919000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-06T01:09:57.542000Z","id":"740738358497509466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Their eyes soften as they watch him. “So it was a good vision.”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:10:34.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740738559387893872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"He nods. \"He came back. From a different plane. He was a man now. He gave off a warm light. We kissed again.\" Cato pauses living in the silence. \"He is out there still. Waiting for me to return to his arms.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:12:01.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740738924158386296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"“You mean he’s alive? Or that he’s waiting in another life?”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:12:48.760000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740739121194074112","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Not alive. Waiting.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:13:03.007000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740739180950323202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They nod and smile. “I could have told you that. My dad is in the same place as him, I’m sure of it. Next year, I could ask my father to be sure.”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:14:04.444000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740739438635646977","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"You can speak with the dead?\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:14:27.936000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740739537168236644","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"“Once a year, I can speak with my father. It was a gift from his god, given to me after my father died.” They look fond. “From when the sun touches the horizon til it disappears, I can speak with him.”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:16:00.950000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740739927297490955","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Cato smiles \"What a wonderful gift.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:16:31.773000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740740056578261065","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"“And he’s a guardian of the underworld in death, as a head cleric to the lord Kelemvor of the Crystal Spire.”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:16:49.269000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740740129962066102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They smile. “It’s why I believe so strongly in the gods. I’ve met two.”","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:17:12.023000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740740225399128135","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"You have been a good friend Wynne. Thank you.\" Cato looks longingly into the setting sun. \"My time in Roanoke is coming to an end.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T01:17:55.560000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740740408006541404","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
